{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Will you trust in it</b> — that your labor is great, on account of the abundance of its strength." "<b>and leave your labor to it</b> — its meaning is the seed of the field, which by its strength it will plow and thresh like the work of an ox. And some say: תעזוב means to place upon its back, as in the phrase עזוב תעזוב עמו, and this is very far-fetched."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:11.362492520Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}